# Backend

Minimal, production-ready FastAPI foundation for the SaaS platform.

## Structure

```text
backend/
|-- app/
|   |-- api/
|   |   `-- v1/
|   |       |-- api.py
|   |       `-- endpoints/
|   |           |-- health.py
|   |           `-- root.py
|   |-- core/
|   |   |-- config.py
|   |   |-- lifespan.py
|   |   `-- logging.py
|   `-- shared/
|       `-- responses.py
|-- requirements/
|-- tests/
|-- .env.example
|-- pyproject.toml
`-- README.md
```
